Subject: Reject observed silent rendering loss and invalid path assertions

Changes to LGPL-2.1-or-later libgxps 0.3.2, 2026-10-28.
Keep the library API/ABI unchanged. The worker treats warnings as failure.
This is not a complete XPS feature/conformance audit.

